WEBVTT

NOTE Ironvale Manufacturing — plant visit debrief

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Priya Raman>You walked me through the line this morning. What did you want me to take away from it?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Grigor Petrov>That the paperwork is the bottleneck, not the machines. Every changeover needs a quality sheet signed on paper and then typed in again upstairs.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
<v Grigor Petrov>We lose about forty minutes a changeover, and we do six a day.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
<v Priya Raman>Our tablets capture that at the line. Nobody types anything twice.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Grigor Petrov>The operators would need it to work with gloves on. That has killed two other trials here.
